WEBVTT

00:12.970 --> 00:18.710
Hikari ga sasu sora, umareochiru kage
In the bright sky illuminated by
sunlight, darkened shadows are born.

00:18.810 --> 00:24.150
Unmei wa dokomademo hikisakareru
Fate itself is being torn apart.

00:25.190 --> 00:30.150
Donna toki mo kesshite akiramenainara
If you never give up, no matter what happens,

00:30.330 --> 00:37.560
mada tozasareteru tobira kanarazu hiraku
Even that locked door will open for you.

00:38.530 --> 00:43.990
Eien datte dakishimete, fuuin mo tokihanachi
Embrace eternity and release the seal.

00:44.070 --> 00:49.940
Mamorubekimono ga ima kokoni wa arukara
Because the ones you wish
to protect are right here.

00:49.940 --> 00:55.880
Namida mo gyutto dakishimete,
yasashisa de tsutsumikomi
Embrace their tears with kindness.

00:55.880 --> 01:01.560
Nagareru mizu no youni tsuyoku nare
Become strong like the formless water,

01:01.560 --> 01:07.550
omouyouni tsuyoku nare
Become as strong as you wish to be.

01:07.700 --> 01:13.170
Mou jibun ni obienaide
Stop being afraid of yourself.

01:13.170 --> 01:19.800
Sou mirai wo osorenaide
Do not fear the future.

01:37.630 --> 01:40.590
Sir, you were at Izumo, right?

01:40.930 --> 01:42.330
How was your vacation?

01:42.530 --> 01:44.620
Not bad, I guess.

01:52.610 --> 01:53.700
Wha...

01:53.940 --> 01:56.470
What the hell is this?!

01:58.050 --> 02:03.020
Our Fox Deity, Bakes Some Sweet Potatoes

02:03.020 --> 02:04.880
Suzunose Community Center

02:16.030 --> 02:17.360
Takagami!

02:18.100 --> 02:19.590
Hey, Sakura.

02:19.900 --> 02:21.440
Did you dress up as Dracula?

02:21.440 --> 02:23.770
Yeah, and you're a...

02:26.440 --> 02:28.930
I'm supposed to be a witch.

02:29.710 --> 02:31.240
Do I look weird?

02:31.950 --> 02:34.350
I guess my skirt's a bit too short.

02:34.350 --> 02:36.280
It's not! I think it's just right!

02:36.950 --> 02:39.450
N-No, I mean...

02:39.450 --> 02:43.390
A-Anyway, isn't this your first time
at Suzunose's Halloween party?

02:43.560 --> 02:46.220
Yeah, someone in the badminton
club asked me to come.

02:46.830 --> 02:49.990
But I only joined because
I heard you were coming.

02:52.030 --> 02:54.430
Simply put, it's just a costume parade.

02:54.940 --> 02:59.270
The kids dress up in costumes, get divided
into groups, and then go out to get treats.

02:59.810 --> 03:04.070
And high school students
like us will be chaperoning...

03:04.580 --> 03:07.450
The sight of Takagami looking after kids...

03:08.820 --> 03:10.490
- He'll probably be really kind.

03:10.490 --> 03:11.350
- Daddy! Over here!
- He'll probably be really kind.

03:11.350 --> 03:12.020
- Daddy! Over here!
- He'll be a great father after we marry.

03:12.020 --> 03:13.680
- He'll be a great father after we marry.

03:15.160 --> 03:18.130
What am I thinking?!

03:18.130 --> 03:23.190
But I'd rather have at least
two kids, like a boy and a girl...

03:23.570 --> 03:26.030
All right. Let's get started.

03:26.030 --> 03:27.130
Let's go, Sakura.

03:27.840 --> 03:29.130
S-Sure.

03:45.550 --> 03:48.250
Are they all yokai?

03:49.860 --> 03:51.160
It seems that way.

03:51.160 --> 03:53.750
I didn't know there were so many in Suzunose.

03:55.000 --> 03:57.760
I think that's only a part of them.

03:58.030 --> 04:01.260
Did the store owner ask you guys to come, too?

04:02.600 --> 04:05.510
Yes. He invited you, too?

04:06.010 --> 04:08.480
Yeah. I wonder what it's about.

04:10.580 --> 04:11.980
Gather round!

04:14.350 --> 04:16.110
Good evening.

04:16.650 --> 04:20.020
I had everyone come here
today for a certain reason.

04:20.620 --> 04:23.680
A Binbogami has entered Suzunose.

04:24.030 --> 04:25.150
A Binbogami?

04:25.530 --> 04:29.360
I saw a post in the god community
site online, so I know it's true!

04:29.930 --> 04:32.430
The Binbogami came here last month.

04:32.430 --> 04:34.460
I heard it went to Suzunose.

04:34.800 --> 04:35.960
What? Seriously?!

04:36.770 --> 04:41.170
Well, that's why I want everyone to split
up and try to capture the Binbogami.

04:42.680 --> 04:44.840
Why can't we just let it be?

04:45.180 --> 04:49.980
Yeah. Even if he possesses a
human, it has nothing to do with us.

04:50.050 --> 04:53.210
It'll be the fault of the
human who gets possessed.

04:53.390 --> 04:58.190
You're right that a Binbogami can't
enter a household unless invited.

04:58.190 --> 05:01.130
And as long as he can't enter a home,
he can't possess anyone.

05:01.400 --> 05:03.360
But tonight is Halloween.

05:04.870 --> 05:06.270
What about it?

05:06.470 --> 05:11.530
If he blends in with the costume parade,
anyone would welcome him into their home.

05:11.810 --> 05:15.210
If we don't do something,
many homes will fall victim tonight.

05:15.610 --> 05:16.670
When that happens...

05:17.010 --> 05:19.310
There will be a sudden increase in poor people.

05:19.880 --> 05:22.210
That'll ruin my business!

05:25.890 --> 05:27.980
Yeah, I got nothing to do with this.

05:28.820 --> 05:32.090
Me, too. I'm not dealing with humans anyway.

05:32.230 --> 05:34.020
You're just being selfish here!

05:34.200 --> 05:36.690
This problem involves all of Suzunose!

05:40.540 --> 05:43.440
I won't ask you to do this for free.

05:44.840 --> 05:49.330
The person who catches the
Binbogami will get some prize money!

05:50.880 --> 05:53.720
O-Our god is giving away prize money?!

05:53.720 --> 05:54.840
Is he serious?!

05:55.480 --> 05:57.510
He's probably going to pay
us in leaves or something.

05:58.420 --> 05:59.480
The amount is...

06:03.390 --> 06:04.420
100,000!

06:04.790 --> 06:06.160
Boom!

06:06.530 --> 06:07.650
It'll be all yours!

06:09.560 --> 06:11.470
What happened to him?!

06:11.470 --> 06:13.460
I've never seen him like this!

06:13.940 --> 06:17.460
Is he really the same god we know?

06:17.810 --> 06:19.740
He could be an impostor.

06:21.780 --> 06:23.680
You better cut it out.

06:23.850 --> 06:25.610
100,000 yen...

06:25.780 --> 06:27.080
Ko-chan.

06:27.080 --> 06:27.570
Yes?

06:27.720 --> 06:30.580
Is the Binbogami that much trouble?

06:30.920 --> 06:34.020
Well, about that...

06:34.020 --> 06:38.150
Though "Binbogami" may
mean "God of Poverty"...

06:38.360 --> 06:41.160
...he doesn't bring poverty with him.

06:41.160 --> 06:44.700
He sucks up the good luck
already existing in a household.

06:44.700 --> 06:47.070
He eats good luck, as they would say.

06:48.500 --> 06:51.770
Any home the Binbogami enters
will be struck with misfortune.

06:52.310 --> 06:57.010
For some people, it's very obvious
they've been struck with bad luck.

06:59.350 --> 07:02.870
The Binbogami has a white mask and white cape.

07:03.250 --> 07:05.850
Now, everyone. Happy hunting.

07:08.990 --> 07:10.250
Let's go, Daigoro!

07:14.900 --> 07:15.860
Toru-sama.

07:16.360 --> 07:17.200
Yeah?

07:17.200 --> 07:20.460
Do you want that 100,000 yen?

07:22.600 --> 07:25.700
I thought Noboru might like it...

07:26.710 --> 07:28.200
I guess I want it after all.

07:28.340 --> 07:31.350
Then I shall search for the Binbogami, too.

07:31.350 --> 07:34.040
Really? Then I'll go with you!

07:34.380 --> 07:36.350
It seems like fun.

07:36.820 --> 07:37.940
Do you want to come, Ku-chan?

07:38.790 --> 07:39.680
Don't feel like it.

07:40.120 --> 07:43.110
Hey komainus. Gather the fallen leaves.

07:43.220 --> 07:44.560
Why?

07:44.730 --> 07:46.820
Wait, why are you ordering us around?

07:47.130 --> 07:49.460
I'm going to bake some sweet potatoes!

07:50.530 --> 07:52.860
I got some from Noboru before we went out.

07:53.170 --> 07:55.930
Cooking sweet potatoes at the shrine?
That's blasphemy!

07:56.170 --> 07:58.900
Do you really think we'll let you do that?!

08:00.340 --> 08:02.210
I have enough for you two.

08:04.810 --> 08:06.750
Oh, fine.

08:07.150 --> 08:08.880
We'll let it slide just this time.

08:09.450 --> 08:12.040
Trick or treat!

08:13.550 --> 08:14.820
Here you go!

08:15.920 --> 08:17.820
Come on. Thank the nice lady.

08:18.030 --> 08:20.650
Thank you very much!

08:21.300 --> 08:22.600
Thanks for doing this for them.

08:22.600 --> 08:23.590
Not at all.

08:23.900 --> 08:25.160
Ready to go, everyone?

08:34.680 --> 08:37.870
A white mask and a white cape...

08:42.850 --> 08:44.220
Can you tell, Ko-chan?

08:44.920 --> 08:49.120
He is not human, so I may
know if I stare long enough.

08:51.060 --> 08:53.730
Thank you very much!

08:53.730 --> 08:54.850
Okay! Let's go!

09:01.140 --> 09:03.400
Hold on. I think that should be enough.

09:03.400 --> 09:05.200
Hey! Toru-san!

09:07.810 --> 09:10.470
Are you looking for the Binbogami, too?

09:10.810 --> 09:13.540
O-Ogami-san?! What happened to your face?!

09:14.880 --> 09:18.580
Well, the Binbogami could be among
the crowd of the costume parade.

09:18.820 --> 09:22.260
So I thought I should look like
I'm wearing a costume, too.

09:22.460 --> 09:24.730
But it looks a bit too real in your case.

09:24.730 --> 09:28.830
It'll be fine. The special makeup sold
these days is supposed to be really good.

09:28.830 --> 09:30.630
That's a lot more than makeup...

09:30.900 --> 09:32.630
Your facial structure is different.

09:32.630 --> 09:34.430
Don't worry!

09:36.840 --> 09:38.570
M-Monster!

09:39.240 --> 09:40.260
See?

09:40.440 --> 09:41.740
Hmm...

09:46.450 --> 09:49.140
You look wonderful, mister!

09:49.720 --> 09:51.620
Oh, thanks.

09:52.020 --> 09:53.510
You all look really cute, too.

09:54.990 --> 09:57.860
What's your type, mister?

09:58.130 --> 10:00.250
Do you have a girlfriend?

10:00.490 --> 10:02.620
What do you think of younger women?

10:05.070 --> 10:06.160
What am I supposed to think?

10:06.270 --> 10:08.600
Girls these days are so precocious.

10:24.890 --> 10:25.580
Hey!

10:26.950 --> 10:28.980
Did you get your candy?

10:32.430 --> 10:35.830
The other kids will take all of it if you don't hurry.

10:38.100 --> 10:39.830
You don't want any candy?

10:42.270 --> 10:44.760
Does he hate me or something?

10:46.670 --> 10:49.610
I know. Let me give you this.

10:50.650 --> 10:52.250
I just got it earlier.

10:52.250 --> 10:54.050
I don't eat sweets that often anyway.

10:54.050 --> 10:56.950
Thank you very much!

11:01.090 --> 11:05.020
I can't tell what he's thinking at all!

11:05.360 --> 11:07.330
Dracula!

11:07.600 --> 11:08.890
Coming!

11:37.090 --> 11:40.460
Here you go.

11:42.660 --> 11:44.700
Okay, now thank the nice lady.

11:44.700 --> 11:47.460
Thank you very much!

11:53.310 --> 11:55.840
Look! The size of the fire is perfect!

11:55.840 --> 11:58.350
I can't wait to eat them!

11:58.350 --> 11:59.540
Don't rush it!

12:00.180 --> 12:04.480
It's all about firepower and cooking time! This is
the moment of truth for roasting sweet potatoes!

12:05.390 --> 12:06.790
I guess you'll have to stay on
guard all the way through.

12:07.350 --> 12:09.460
But when we emerge victorious...

12:09.460 --> 12:14.030
The steamy and delicious sweet
potatoes will be waiting for us!

12:14.030 --> 12:16.220
Steamy!

12:16.700 --> 12:18.060
M-My drool!

12:18.370 --> 12:20.420
Roasting sweet potatoes?

12:21.000 --> 12:23.240
Where do you think you are?

12:23.240 --> 12:24.670
This is, um!

12:24.810 --> 12:26.710
You're not getting one.

12:26.840 --> 12:27.930
I don't want any.

12:28.380 --> 12:30.340
So warm...

12:30.580 --> 12:31.840
By the way, Ebisu...

12:31.950 --> 12:32.810
What?

12:33.480 --> 12:37.180
Why are you so fixated on the Binbogami?

12:37.490 --> 12:39.980
It's for my worshipers.

12:40.650 --> 12:44.180
It's natural for the presiding deity to
worry about the people of his land.

12:44.690 --> 12:48.690
The Binbogami never takes that
much good luck from a single person.

12:49.060 --> 12:54.000
He only takes a little bit from everyone
to minimize the trouble he causes.

12:54.440 --> 12:56.800
I think you should leave him alone.

12:56.940 --> 12:59.930
You don't run a business so you
have no idea how dangerous he is!

13:00.810 --> 13:02.670
No, I don't get it! Never will!

13:06.280 --> 13:09.370
I just don't think he's that bad...

13:10.180 --> 13:11.820
Lucky...

13:11.820 --> 13:14.310
I didn't get that!

13:18.290 --> 13:20.780
Trick or treat!

13:28.700 --> 13:31.100
Looks like you got a lot!

13:35.580 --> 13:37.170
Well? Having fun?

13:38.550 --> 13:40.480
Oh, that's good.

13:42.620 --> 13:46.690
Well, I have a little brother.

13:46.690 --> 13:52.130
He was really shy when he was smaller,
but he joined the little league and...

13:52.130 --> 13:55.030
...he made a lot of friends at school.

13:56.560 --> 14:01.000
If you just jump in headfirst,
you might be pleasantly surprised sometimes.

14:01.700 --> 14:03.290
When it comes to making friends, that is.

14:03.600 --> 14:05.730
But I guess I wouldn't really know.

14:23.220 --> 14:26.020
Where is that Binbogami?

14:27.600 --> 14:28.290
I do not know...

14:28.500 --> 14:32.660
I thought Ogami-san's plan
with the disguises would work.

14:38.010 --> 14:39.210
It's a doggy!

14:39.210 --> 14:40.000
Doggy!

14:41.210 --> 14:43.200
Isn't this a fox?

14:43.740 --> 14:44.970
Sakura-san?

14:45.410 --> 14:47.540
Toru-kun! And Ko-chan, too.

14:47.920 --> 14:49.380
You're here for this party, too?

14:50.020 --> 14:51.040
Something like that.

14:51.390 --> 14:53.220
Hey! Daigoro-chan!

14:55.060 --> 14:56.860
You know this fox?

14:56.860 --> 14:57.410
Yes!

14:58.890 --> 15:01.230
What are you doing here?

15:03.730 --> 15:07.260
Ogami-san told him to wait here.

15:08.400 --> 15:12.240
Wait here? What's Ogami-san doing?

15:22.520 --> 15:25.950
A white mask and a white cape!

15:26.150 --> 15:27.660
He's not human.

15:27.660 --> 15:28.380
Then that means!

15:33.260 --> 15:35.100
I found you, Binbogami!

15:35.100 --> 15:36.390
Come here!

15:40.130 --> 15:41.070
Ko-chan!

15:41.070 --> 15:41.590
Yes!

15:43.900 --> 15:45.840
Get back here, Binbogami!

16:11.330 --> 16:13.890
Those are some flashy costumes.

16:16.540 --> 16:17.710
Where did he go?!

16:17.710 --> 16:20.140
The 100,000 yen will be mine!

16:26.710 --> 16:27.840
I found you!

16:49.570 --> 16:51.370
O-Ogami-san?

16:53.970 --> 16:56.640
Bye! See you next year.

16:57.040 --> 16:59.410
I'll definitely come again!

16:59.410 --> 17:01.250
See you again!

17:01.250 --> 17:02.080
Bye-bye!

17:03.820 --> 17:05.340
It's finally over.

17:06.990 --> 17:08.510
I guess Sakura is still with her group.

17:08.790 --> 17:10.810
I guess I'll get changed and...

17:23.600 --> 17:25.570
I-Is it done yet?

17:25.570 --> 17:27.070
I think it's done...

17:27.070 --> 17:29.740
Be patient! If you rush, you'll ruin them.

17:33.610 --> 17:38.020
I couldn't keep my fox face
so I tried wearing a mask.

17:38.190 --> 17:43.220
I thought the Binbogami
went inside someone's home.

17:43.220 --> 17:44.780
That's why I tried to take a look inside...

17:47.530 --> 17:50.550
So no one caught the Binbogami.

17:51.400 --> 17:52.090
Ku?

17:52.430 --> 17:53.400
Noboru?

17:53.570 --> 17:54.690
Noboru-sama?

17:55.370 --> 17:57.740
Toru, Ko, and even Ogami-san?

17:57.940 --> 17:59.070
What are you all doing?

17:59.070 --> 18:00.340
A bonfire...

18:00.340 --> 18:01.900
Oh, you're cooking sweet potatoes.

18:02.140 --> 18:04.370
You did ask for them earlier.

18:04.580 --> 18:07.980
Stop talking to me! This is important here!

18:07.980 --> 18:08.470
What?

18:09.420 --> 18:11.280
N-Noboru-kun! He's!

18:14.690 --> 18:15.990
No way!

18:15.990 --> 18:18.750
Th-The Binbogami!

18:21.530 --> 18:23.160
Wh-What?

18:26.930 --> 18:28.900
Congratulations.

18:29.300 --> 18:33.030
The winner of the prize
money is Takagami Noboru!

18:36.340 --> 18:37.870
And now for the award ceremony!

18:38.280 --> 18:39.580
100,000 yen?!

18:39.580 --> 18:43.380
I don't know how it happened,
but 100,000 yen?! Lucky me!

18:47.890 --> 18:50.480
Here's your prize of 100,000 dong!

18:53.060 --> 18:53.650
What?

18:55.330 --> 18:58.560
100,000 dong?

18:59.700 --> 19:00.170
Dong.

19:01.140 --> 19:02.860
What's dong?

19:03.000 --> 19:04.370
It's the currency for Vietnam.

19:04.610 --> 19:07.630
It's worth about 700 yen in total.

19:07.810 --> 19:09.140
700 yen?

19:09.580 --> 19:12.510
But I thought you said 100,000 yen...

19:13.550 --> 19:15.110
When did I say that?

19:15.350 --> 19:16.880
Don't you remember?

19:16.880 --> 19:20.450
"100,000! Boom! It's all yours."

19:20.450 --> 19:22.850
"100,000!"

19:23.390 --> 19:24.080
Yeah...

19:27.290 --> 19:29.390
What the hell?!

19:32.430 --> 19:33.760
There there. Calm down, people.

19:34.030 --> 19:35.500
How are we supposed to calm down?!

19:37.540 --> 19:40.340
Are you really a Binbogami?

19:42.580 --> 19:44.270
And this is for me?

19:46.380 --> 19:47.570
Why?

19:51.150 --> 19:53.210
Maybe he likes you.

19:54.760 --> 19:56.090
Huh? Why?

19:59.990 --> 20:04.950
Did you take all the good luck you
gathered tonight and give it to Noboru?

20:06.030 --> 20:07.260
100,000 dong.

20:08.040 --> 20:10.470
So you got 700 yen worth of good luck.

20:10.600 --> 20:14.840
The good luck you gathered really was small.

20:17.540 --> 20:20.780
T-Tenko-sama! Aren't they done yet?

20:22.980 --> 20:26.050
All right! Take out the sweet potatoes!

20:26.050 --> 20:27.250
Understood!

20:27.250 --> 20:29.050
Charge! At the sweet potatoes!

20:29.420 --> 20:32.020
Can I have some, Ku-chan?

20:32.230 --> 20:33.990
Sure, I'll share.

20:34.090 --> 20:39.620
Hey, Binbogami! Come over
here and I'll give you some!

20:40.070 --> 20:42.400
I put my heart into making this...

20:44.300 --> 20:47.400
No! It can't be!

20:47.570 --> 20:49.180
It's completely charred.

20:49.180 --> 20:51.440
T-T-Tenko-sama!

20:52.050 --> 20:56.480
The size of the flame and cooking
time were calculated perfectly!

20:57.780 --> 20:58.550
Could it be?!

20:58.650 --> 20:59.780
It's you!

21:04.490 --> 21:06.150
Tenko-sama, yours is charred, too.

21:06.490 --> 21:11.430
Damn you! He sucked up our good luck, too!

21:11.730 --> 21:14.830
I'll get my revenge for this!

21:15.140 --> 21:17.970
The sweet potatoes...

21:26.110 --> 21:28.480
I hope you'll come back to visit.

21:55.210 --> 22:00.480
Hare mo ke mo naku oowarawa de neboketerarenai
With all the commotion, I can't stay still.

22:00.980 --> 22:06.510
Kidoairaku gochamaze aa ijou
With emotions running wild,
everything seems so odd.

22:06.820 --> 22:12.320
Inochimijikashi toiunonara hara wo kukutte
Life is short so be prepared for anything.

22:12.630 --> 22:17.690
Iran kyoukai nanno sono yuke
Transcend that useless boundary and go!

22:17.760 --> 22:18.390
Kitsune Soba

22:18.800 --> 22:24.470
kingin kagayaku suteki na mainichi
With those bright days behind you,

22:24.600 --> 22:30.410
omatsurisawagi de mairouka
It's time for some merrymaking.

22:30.980 --> 22:36.810
Sora ni hi wo tomoshi tamashii no pareedo
Light the skies for this parade of souls,

22:36.950 --> 22:42.680
shiawase no kotodama hora kousa suru
The kotodama of happiness crosses paths.

22:42.820 --> 22:48.420
Namida mo wasurete odori odore
Forget those tears and dance away,

22:48.660 --> 22:54.570
toriaezu iiyone tanoshikeryasa
Forget about everything else
since we're having fun now.

23:12.750 --> 23:17.020
This is strange. The sales are still going down.

23:17.020 --> 23:19.460
This wasn't because of the Binbogami?

